---
title: "deny_list_v2_enable_global_pause (Sui Framework: coin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_pause: assert deny_cap.allow_global_pause
    q_check_pause --> q_abort: allow_global_pause == false
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EGlobalPauseNotAllowed
    q_check_pause --> q_get_type: allow_global_pause == true
    q_get_type --> q_delegate: deny_list.v2_enable_global_pause(index, ty, ctx)
    q_delegate --> q_config: set GlobalPauseKey = true for next epoch
    q_config --> [*]: global pause enabled

    note right of q_check_pause
        INV-001: allow_global_pause must be set at DenyCapV2 creation time
        INV-002: global pause affects ALL addresses immediately for inputs
        INV-003: per-address entries are NOT affected by global pause state
    end note
